<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106673" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλ-ώδης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ες.</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woody, wooded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					215
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος, λόφος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dicaearch.
				2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					6.7
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑ.</span>
			<i>wooded ground,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ψιλά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>. </div>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>turbid, muddy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.81
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμός, λίμναι, ῥεῖθρον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sull.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Brut.</u>
				51
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					David
					<u>Proll.</u>
					79.3
				</span></i>
			: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span> IV. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
